T*
(* KCL represents charge conservation at nodes; KVL represents energy conservation) Tj
T*
(around loops.) Tj
T*
(* Thevenin equivalent consists of V_th in series with R_th; Norton equivalent) Tj
T*
(consists of I_N in parallel with R_N \(where V_th = I_N * R_th\).) Tj
T*
(* Maximum power transfer occurs at R_L = R_th with 50% efficiency \(P_max = V_th^2 /) Tj
T*
(4*R_th\).) Tj
T*
